Neither value is used. `lifecycle::merge_lifecycle_fanout` is in fact called (lifecycle.rs:111, translate.rs:321), so its line is pure noise. The free function `create::ensure_repo_then_create` (create.rs:230-241) is a one-line delegation to the inherent method of the same name, and the only callers in the workspace — dispatch.rs:103, dispatch.rs:244, create.rs:239 — all use the method, so the free wrapper is dead and this statement is what hides it.

